  "html": "<div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 1–5</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Complete the notes. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><h4 class=\"task-title\">Get Away Tours</h4><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Office hours: 10am to 7pm</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Cost of cheapest tour per person is $<input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"1\" id=\"q1\" name=\"q1\" placeholder=\"1\" aria-label=\"Question 1\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> (this month only)</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Price includes accommodation and meals</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>The number of bicycle trips to choose from is <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"2\" id=\"q2\" name=\"q2\" placeholder=\"2\" aria-label=\"Question 2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Most tours last a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"3\" id=\"q3\" name=\"q3\" placeholder=\"3\" aria-label=\"Question 3\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>This company offers <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"4\" id=\"q4\" name=\"q4\" placeholder=\"4\" aria-label=\"Question 4\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> holidays as well as bicycling</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>Travellers start their trips on <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"5\" id=\"q5\" name=\"q5\" placeholder=\"5\" aria-label=\"Question 5\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\"